---
/** Shown (by src/client/api.ts) when a lab can't reach the site's Node server. */
---

<div class="callout server-notice" data-kind="warn" data-server-notice hidden>
  <p class="callout__label">Needs the server</p>
  <p>
    This lab talks to the site's Node backend, which isn't reachable here. Run
    <code>npm start</code> in <code>websites/04-web-engineering</code> and open
    <code>http://localhost:4400</code>.
  </p>
</div>
